                           QUICK START (1.5 HOURS)
═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. OPEN PROJECT (5 min)
   $ cd /workspaces/Only-player
   $ godot --path .

2. CREATE MAIN SCENE (30 min)
   • Follow SCENE_STRUCTURE.md
   • Create node hierarchy manually
   • Configure collision shapes
   • Save as res://scenes/Main.tscn

3. ATTACH SCRIPTS (15 min)
   • PlayerController.gd → Player
   • SmoothCamera.gd → Player/Camera3D
   • SafeZone.gd → SafeZone
   • GameManager.gd → GameManager
   • MobileHUD.gd → MobileHUD (already in scene)

4. TEST CONTROLS (20 min)
   • Press F5 to play
   • Keyboard: WASD + Mouse + Space
   • Mobile: Joysticks + Buttons
   • Verify 120 FPS (Tools > Monitor)

5. CUSTOMIZE (1+ hours)
   • Add player model & animations
   • Create weapon models
   • Add sound effects
   • Implement AI enemies

